{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're thrilled to announce a huge paid DLC that will elevate the AMERICAN SUNSET experience to new heights! This expansion is packed with features you\u2019ve been asking for, offering fresh paths and thrilling events tailored to your choices. Here\u2019s a sneak peek at what\u2019s coming:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Story Paths - <strong>Cuckold or Alpha Routes</strong>.\u00a0Your choice of being a cuckold or an alpha will shape Tracy\u2019s behavior and interactions. In the cuckold path, Tracy will impose limits on sexual interactions with Justin, adding a layer of emotional intensity to the narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Events in Iconic Locations</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to Las Vegas</strong>: Expect two distinct visits to Vegas for Tracy and Justin, with unique events for both cuckold and alpha paths (that\u2019s four different scenarios!). Highlights include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Justin receives Tracy\u2019s blessing to hook up with Courtney (the blonde from the wet t-shirt contest) and, during the second visit, shares Tracy with a room service guy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cuckold path, Tracy humiliates Justin during an encounter with a Russian poker player. During their second Vegas trip, she becomes the plaything of a fraternity of Ivy League elites, right in front of a stunned Justin.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swingers Club Adventures</strong>: The swingers\u2019 club experience will vary dramatically based on your path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one scenario, Tracy is tied up, dominated, and gang-banged in front of Justin, who holds her hand as the scene unfolds with intense passion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On another path, Tracy and Justin visit the club with Amanda, unlocking a variety of steamy, unforgettable scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118750/extras/3dc7999ca9365298a1f55bfeeb24734b.poster.avif?t=1761678761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118750/extras/3dc7999ca9365298a1f55bfeeb24734b.webm?t=1761678761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118750/extras/3dc7999ca9365298a1f55bfeeb24734b.mp4?t=1761678761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayability and Depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expansion is designed to encourage replaying from scratch, with distinct events and outcomes based on your cuckold or alpha choice. Each path offers unique motivations and experiences, ensuring no two playthroughs feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is just a taste of what\u2019s in store for this massive expansion!</strong> More details and ideas will be shared soon, including content with Lisa, Derek and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118750?t=1761678761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118750/44b39f8da45045d32c95f577ff4a2010f16530f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761678761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118750/45636fdbd491dd72e69cdd5495f8305b109f9571/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761678761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118750/45636fdbd491dd72e69cdd5495f8305b109f9571/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761678761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achieve